<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH COKOLADOVNY Q1 97 PROFIT RISES YR/YR.</title>
<headline>CZECH COKOLADOVNY Q1 97 PROFIT RISES YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for three month period</p>
<p>ending March 31, 1997, according to Czech accounting standards</p>
<p>(in millions of crowns):</p>
<p> Gross profit		   529.25    vs	234.00</p>
<p> Net profit		     325.30    vs	   n/a</p>
<p> Operating profit	     520.33    vs	   n/a</p>
<p>Sales of own goods</p>
<p> and services		 2,674.49    vs	   n/a</p>
<p> Total sales		  2,790.80    vs    2,576.00</p>
<p> Total assets		 8,051.27    vs	   n/a</p>
<p> Basic capital		3,127.70    vs	   n/a</p>
<p>NOTE. Full company name is Cokoladovny a.s. .</p>
<p>Cokoladovny Partners, a consortium of Groupe Danone </p>
<p>and Nestle SA holds an 81 percent stake in the firm,</p>
<p>which specialises in chocolate and confectionery. Cokoladovny</p>
<p>shares are traded on the main market of the Prague Stock</p>
<p>Exchange (PSE). Results were provided by the PSE.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
